OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses still struggling with
OL,4,Asea border, Stormont reports find
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operation of Northern Ireland's
OL,7,FBrexit deal is still characterised by
OL,8,Fconfusion, duplication and accumulating
OL,9,Fregulatory burdens on businesses, two
OL,10,Freports have found.
OL,12,FThe studies were commissioned by
OL,13,FStormont's Department for the Economy,
OL,14,Fand look at the practical impacts of
OL,15,Fthe Windsor Framework, the deal agreed
OL,16,Fby the UK and EU in 2023.
OL,18,FThe framework was intended to reduce
OL,19,Fthe impact of the Irish Sea border.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
